            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Oil prices rise, gold slips, Kindly MD-Nakamoto merger",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance host<em>\u00a0</em><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> tracks today's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>, including rising oil prices  (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CL=F\">CL=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BZ=F\">BZ=F</a>) after US and Chinese officials agree to terms, gold prices (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F\">GC=F</a>) slip, and Kindly MD (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/KDLY\">KDLY</a>) shares skyrocket on headlines of its merger with Nakamoto to establish a bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) treasury.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
